   "texto": [
    "When you arrive: **よやく が あります** (I have a reservation).",
    "The rooms: **シングル** (individual), **ツイン** (double, with two beds). The nights are counted with **はく**: **いっぱく** (one night), **にはく** (two nights).",
    "In hotels they will speak with great respect: to your name they will add **さま** instead of **さん**, and they will say **おへや** instead of **へや**.",
    "The plants are counted with **かい** (sometimes «がい»): **3 がい** (third floor).",
    "To confirm: **はい、 そう です** (yes, it is)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "If you're not feeling well",
   "texto": [
    "**だいじょうぶ です か** = are you okay? And the answer: **だいじょうぶ です** (I'm fine).",
    "The pains are said with the body part + **が いたい です**: **あたま が いたい です** (headache), **おなか が いたい です** (stomach pain).",
